BlogSphere

A full-stack blog application built with FastAPI (backend) and React (frontend). Supports user authentication, admin management, and blog CRUD operations.


1.Features
-----------------------
User registration and login
JWT authentication
Admin panel for managing users and posts
Create, update, delete, and view blog posts
Search posts
Responsive frontend with React


2.Tech Stack
----------------------------------
Backend: FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, SQLite
Frontend: React, CSS
Authentication: JWT
Database: SQLite

Setup Backend
-------------------
cd backend
# Create virtual environment
python -m venv env

# Activate virtual environment Linux
source env/bin/activate

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

python main.py


Setup Frontend
--------------------
cd ../frontend

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Start frontend
npm start


Test Users
-----------------
| Username | Password | Role  |
